#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:47
#: c8942b7b6f06414f8d5aa2548992dd58
msgid ""
"The output power rails **FMU PWM OUT** and **I/O PWM OUT** do not power the "
"autopilot board (and are not powered by it). You must supply power to one of"
" **POWER** or **USB** or the board will be unpowered."
msgstr ""
"输出电源轨 **FMU PWM OUT** 和 **I/O PWM OUT** 不为飞控板供电（也不由其供电）。您必须通过 **POWER** 或 "
"**USB** 之一为飞控板供电，否则板子将无法工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:48
#: a93164cf694047ccb3c89be692d949e4
msgid ""
"The USB do not power the **Raspberry Pi CM3+**. You must supply power to "
"**POWER** or the Raspberry Pi CM3+ will be unpowered."
msgstr ""
"USB 不为 **Raspberry Pi CM3+** 供电。您必须通过 **POWER** 为其供电，否则 Raspberry Pi CM3+ "
"将无电。"

