#: 7753d6cad0914ba0a91b4168777b091e
msgid ""
"Serial port protocols (Telem, GPS, etc.) can be adjusted to personal "
"preferences using the ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameter."
msgstr "串口协议（数传、GPS 等）可通过 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 参数根据个人需求调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:64
#: 45ac49a332a344ba93ba84a40911228f
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:66
#: ca407017eec843c0b5341375353b9540
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to timer input, can be used for all"
" ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connetion. However, Fport, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry"
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射到定时器输入，支持 ArduPilot 所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外，这两种协议需要真实的 "
"UART 连接。但是，通过这种方式连接时，Fport 只提供 RC 而不提供数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:68
#: c6aaa6aacf82409aa9f6defd1a78af21
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL4(UART8) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using UART8. "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` should be set to “23”."
msgstr ""
"要启用 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，需要使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL4（UART8））进行接收机连接。以下是使用"
" UART8 的设置方法。应将 :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 设为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:70
#: bb472d726f8c488a9788dcd3940109b0
msgid ""
"Fport would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to”15”"
msgstr "Fport 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设为 「15」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:71
#: 3121791806984adba3a2db0cfb7e8e98
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to “0”"
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设为 「0」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:72
#: 74bc5d1245ac4a15949f2934a665e711
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to “4” "
"and connects only the UART8 TX pin."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设为 「4」，且仅连接 UART8 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:74
#: bc7feaaa75364411aa9c80c261ad1e72
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems "
"<common-rc-systems>` for details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`Radio Control "
"Systems <common-rc-systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:77
#: 894b6c1ae3834221bcd4cf4c615bcfad
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:79
#: 25cf3831dc57435b94bd8d18eeffe375
msgid ""
"The ThePeach FCC-R1 supports up to 14 PWM outputs. All outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats."
msgstr "ThePeach FCC-R1 支持最多 14 路 PWM 输出。所有输出均支持常规 PWM 输出格式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:81
#: 2499818d56ea4b84aeba7db53089abd7
msgid "The 6 FMU PWM (AUX) outputs are in 2 groups and also support DShot:"
msgstr "6 路 FMU PWM（AUX）输出分为 2 组，同时支持 DShot："

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:83
#: 73505fca98e543d5b389b222cc587ef1
msgid "AUX 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "AUX 1、2、3 和 4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:84
#: b6c23c8605cc4b83944a988f0b160b9a
msgid "AUX 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr "AUX 5 和 6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:86
#: 207bf511bee44757a1ff778cc0fed602
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需使用相同的输出速率和协议。如果组内任何输出使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:91
#: 5af3a24f5dc24a7cad7170972680c5bc
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:93
#: d9290a190af34276965213a8ca8d9e69
msgid ""
"The board has 1 dedicated power monitor port whit a pin connector. It is "
"intended for use with the Analog power monitor supplied with the autopilot."
msgstr "飞控板有 1 个专用电源监测端口，带引脚连接器，用于连接飞控随附的模拟电源监测器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:96
#: 3aad09c2bf7042ecb757dcc57cb6ec4e
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:98
#: 20360c23a9b740e7875cc80b423d348e
msgid ""
"The ThePeach FCC-R1 has a built-in MPU9250 compass. Due to potential "
"interference the autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as "
"part of a GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "ThePeach FCC-R1 内置 MPU9250 罗盘。由于潜在干扰，飞控通常与 GPS/罗盘组合模块中的外部 I2C 罗盘配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:101
#: fd96ef86f4974f08a53606d809a62177
msgid "GPIOs"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thepeach-r1.rst:103
#: acbedf6541d34525a7d069ed7bdc737c
msgid ""
"The 6 AUX outputs can be used as GPIOs (relays, buttons, RPM etc). To use "
"them you need to set the output’s SERVOx_FUNTION to -1. See `GPIOs "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-gpios.html#common-gpios>`_ page "
"for more information"
msgstr ""
"6 路 AUX 输出可用作 GPIO（继电器、按钮、转速等）。使用时需将相应输出的 SERVOx_FUNCTION 设为 -1。更多信息请参阅 "
"`GPIO <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-gpios.html#common-gpios>`_ "
"页面"

